# CQ5: Which steps that a sample's temper requires are not reported for it?
PREFIX al:   <https://w3id.org/al6xxx#>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#>

SELECT ?sample ?temper ?missing WHERE {
  ?sample al:hasTemper ?temper .
  ?temper al:impliesStepType ?missing .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?sample al:hasProcessStep/al:stepType ?missing }
} ORDER BY ?sample ?missing
